data: {"id": "a5ce92edd61340ff-thinking-parallel_evidence-1899", "run_id": "a5ce92edd61340ff", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 1. 实体身份与生命周期确认\n\n- **Pod**: `workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r`，命名空间 `aiops-case-10`，UID `f0496f24-4504-47ae-8b6d-685bd1536991`，调度在 `node2`。\n- **Owner**: `ReplicaSet/workload-79d9f8fd88`。\n- **容器**: 单容器 `app`，镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，启动命令 `[\"python3\", \"/opt/aiops/server.py\"]`。\n- **当前状态**:\n  - Pod `phase: Running`，但 `Ready: False` (`ContainersNotReady`)。\n  - 容器 `app` 状态 `CrashLoopBackOff`，重启次数 `25`，**上次退出码 `exitCode=137`**。\n  - Kubelet 事件: `Liveness probe failed: HTTP pro", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 7, "ts_ms": 1789357216094, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

